      "note": "Apple Mac Studio tech specs (opened 2026-11-12): 3.7 x 7.7 x 7.7 in (H x W x D) = 95 x 197 x 197 mm, 2.7 kg (M5 Max) / 3.6 kg (Ultra), silver. Front (M5 Max): two USB-C (up to 10 Gb/s) and an SDXC slot. Back: four Thunderbolt 5 (USB-C), two USB-A (USB 3), one HDMI 2.1, one 10 Gb Ethernet (RJ-45), a 3.5 mm headphone jack and a power socket (inlet type not named, three-prong cord). The SDXC slot, HDMI and the power socket have no catalogue connector or signal and are not ports (drawn on the picture only); Thunderbolt uses the usb-c connector with the usb-audio signal. Positions are GUESSES (no drawing read). A plain filleted box."
